1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:05,588
Learn the ABCs with Mimo! A to F

2
00:00:05,888 --> 00:00:14,478
Mimo: Hi friends! Today we're learning the alphabet! Let's start with the letters A, B, C, D, E and F!

3
00:00:16,078 --> 00:00:22,511
Mimo: Every letter makes a sound, and every letter starts a word. Ready? Let's go!

4
00:00:24,211 --> 00:00:28,210
Mimo: This is the letter A! A says ah, ah, ah.

5
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:29,905
Mimo: Can you say A?

6
00:00:31,805 --> 00:00:34,657
Mimo: A is for apple! Ah, ah, apple!

7
00:00:36,262 --> 00:00:38,865
Bruno: Did somebody say apple? I love apples!

8
00:00:42,565 --> 00:00:46,806
Mimo: Next is the letter B! B says buh, buh, buh.

9
00:00:47,106 --> 00:00:48,464
Mimo: Can you say B?

10
00:00:50,364 --> 00:00:53,308
Mimo: B is for ball! Buh, buh, ball!

11
00:00:55,108 --> 00:00:58,118
Bruno: And B is for Bruno! Buh, buh, Bruno!

12
00:00:58,418 --> 00:01:00,222
Mimo: That's right, Bruno!

13
00:01:01,870 --> 00:01:03,894
Lulu: Hello! Is it my turn yet?

14
00:01:05,594 --> 00:01:09,631
Mimo: This is the letter C! C says cuh, cuh, cuh.

15
00:01:09,931 --> 00:01:11,288
Mimo: Can you say C?

16
00:01:13,188 --> 00:01:18,485
Lulu: C is for cat! Cuh, cuh, cat! That's me! Meow!

17
00:01:21,785 --> 00:01:26,295
Mimo: Here comes the letter D! D says duh, duh, duh.

18
00:01:26,595 --> 00:01:28,007
Mimo: Can you say D?

19
00:01:29,907 --> 00:01:33,597
Mimo: D is for dog! Duh, duh, dog!

20
00:01:33,897 --> 00:01:36,802
Bruno: Woof woof! And D is for... dinner! Is it dinner time?

21
00:01:40,638 --> 00:01:42,520
Pip: Wait for me! I want to help!

22
00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:48,215
Mimo: This is the letter E! E says eh, eh, eh.

23
00:01:48,515 --> 00:01:49,841
Mimo: Can you say E?

24
00:01:51,741 --> 00:01:56,337
Pip: E is for egg! Eh, eh, egg! I came out of an egg when I was a baby!

25
00:01:59,337 --> 00:02:05,443
Mimo: And the last letter today is F! F says fff, fff, fff.

26
00:02:05,743 --> 00:02:07,228
Mimo: Can you say F?

27
00:02:09,128 --> 00:02:13,485
Mimo: F is for fish! Fff, fff, fish!

28
00:02:13,785 --> 00:02:17,108
Bruno: F is also for... food! Fff, fff, food!

29
00:02:17,408 --> 00:02:19,833
Mimo: Bruno! You're always hungry!

30
00:02:20,133 --> 00:02:23,489
Mimo: Let's say all our letters together! Ready?

31
00:02:23,789 --> 00:02:25,112
Mimo: A, apple!

32
00:02:25,912 --> 00:02:27,075
Bruno: B, ball!

33
00:02:27,875 --> 00:02:29,068
Lulu: C, cat!

34
00:02:29,868 --> 00:02:30,734
Bruno: D, dog!

35
00:02:31,534 --> 00:02:32,500
Pip: E, egg!

36
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:34,757
Mimo: F, fish!

37
00:02:36,357 --> 00:02:42,310
Mimo: Great job, friends! You know A, B, C, D, E and F!

38
00:02:42,610 --> 00:02:47,128
Mimo: Next time, we'll learn more letters. Bye bye!
